course: dictionary
lesson: 1468
title: The word cat in context
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Cat has more than one meaning, and context tells you which one you need. A cat is a small furry animal that people keep as a pet, with whiskers, claws and a long tail. It can also mean any animal of the cat family, as in «big cats».
explain: Some phrases use cat without meaning an animal at all. «It is raining cats and dogs» cannot mean animals falling from the sky. The clue is raining, so the phrase means raining hard. «Let the cat out of the bag» means tell a secret.
explain: Sentences can show what cats are like. «Slow blinks mean a cat feels safe with you, while wide, round pupils in good light can mean it is scared or excited.» Ask yourself what word would fit, then try your meaning in the sentence to check it.
fact: Cat is a noun. Its plural is cats.
fact: A cat is a small furry animal that people keep as a pet; it has whiskers, claws and a long tail.
fact: «Big cats» means animals of the cat family, like lions, tigers and leopards.
fact: «Raining cats and dogs» means raining hard, and «let the cat out of the bag» means tell a secret.
fact: In science, cats are mammals and hunters.
exercise: What does cat mean in «big cats»? | *Animals of the cat family, like lions and tigers | Dogs that hunt in packs | Birds that sing at dawn | Small furry pets with a bell on their collar
exercise: «It is raining cats and dogs.» What does this mean? | Animals falling from the sky | *Raining hard | Dogs and cats fighting in the street | Raining very softly
exercise: Find the word from «Slow blinks mean a cat feels safe with you» that tells you the cat is calm. | wide | round | *safe | slow
test: «Let the cat out of the bag» means... | Let a cat go outside | Feed the cat early | Put a cat into a bag | *Tell a secret
test: In science, cats are... | Insects that buzz | Plants that grow in the sun | *Mammals and hunters | Reptiles that lay eggs
exam: In «a scaredy-cat», the word cat means... | A cat with a bell on its collar | *A person who is easily scared | A lion in a zoo | A cat that hunts birds
